1
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:41,000
My name is Gu Yan.

2
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,679
I'm a criminal psychologist.

3
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,560
Ever since I was ten,

4
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,079
I've known one thing:

5
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:47,320
in this world,

6
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,920
there is no perfect crime,

7
00:00:49,159 --> 00:00:51,200
only truths that haven't been uncovered.

8
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,039
I've studied 472

9
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:54,119
serial murder cases,

10
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,240
drawn over 100 criminal profiles,

11
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,439
and helped the police solve 36 cold cases.

12
00:00:58,439 --> 00:01:00,000
Yet there's one case

13
00:01:00,119 --> 00:01:01,640
I still have no answer to.

14
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,200
All the killer left at the scene

15
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,079
was a mysterious coin,

16
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:07,040
and the last look my mother gave me

17
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,719
before she stopped breathing.

18
00:01:12,599 --> 00:01:13,599
Hello, Lu Yuan.

19
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,040
The Great Expert Gu.

20
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,560
We have a case,

21
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,280
and we need your help.

22
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,719
Upholding justice

23
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:20,920
is my duty.

24
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,280
It's my honor.

25
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:23,640
Thanks for this.

26
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,799
By the way,

27
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:28,519
any progress on my mother's case?

28
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:30,439
Not yet.

29
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:33,239
Gu Yan, give me a little more time.

30
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,439
All right.

31
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:38,319
Thanks. I'm driving, so I'll hang up now.

32
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,680
Hey, Lu Yuan.

33
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:25,400
Gu Yan.

34
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,919
Look at the files I just sent you.

35
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,840
Both victims so far

36
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,240
have had their sexual characteristics removed.

37
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:36,759
It shows the killer is mentally deranged

38
00:02:36,879 --> 00:02:38,120
and psychologically twisted.

39
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,840
This is already the second case.

40
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,599
If we don't solve this quickly,

41
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,240
it could easily turn into a serial murder case.

42
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,439
Where are you right now?

43
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,439
I'm at Star Cafe near the crime scene.

44
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,680
Okay, I'm on my way.

45
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,800
Why did you come back in?

46
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:54,360
Why don't you think carefully

47
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,479
about how I might be able to help you?

48
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:57,639
I don't need any help.

49
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,439
I already told you, I don't need it.

50
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,120
I'm not letting you become my assistant.

51
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:13,199
P-Put me down!

52
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,240
Put me down!

53
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,240
Yeah, yeah.

54
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,960
You're not in a rush,

55
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,319
but I am.

56
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:37,599
A stranger brought you to the hospital,

57
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,759
but he was pretty handsome.

58
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,080
Where to?

59
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,639
Star Cafe on the east side.

60
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,840
Miss Gu is always one step ahead.

61
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,800
Just doing what I can.

62
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,960
I really appreciate your help today.

63
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,599
Let's call it a day.

64
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,319
Sorry to trouble you.

65
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,279
This is the last time.

66
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,279
Gu Yan, your leg...

67
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,240
For this case...

68
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,360
It was from a car accident.

69
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,920
Let's take a look together

70
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,319
at the criminal profiling for this case.

71
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,199
Alright.

72
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,759
The scene was chaotic.

73
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,839
The female victim

74
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,279
had her sexual characteristics mutilated,

75
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,079
a hallmark of pathological crime.

76
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,720
There are clear signs of overkill.

77
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:53,160
The number of wounds on the victim

78
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,639
far exceeded what was lethal.

79
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,079
The stab wounds vary in depth,

80
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,040
indicating the killer

81
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:57,879
was venting his rage

82
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,959
in a state of extreme emotion.

83
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:00,959
Lacking social skills,

84
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,319
highly emotionally unstable,

85
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,720
and clumsy in his methods.

86
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,680
His cleanup of the scene was also very amateurish,

87
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,639
suggesting the killer likely works

88
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:09,959
an unskilled job.

89
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,639
The victim was placed

90
00:05:12,199 --> 00:05:13,560
in a corner resembling confinement.

91
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:15,800
Some items at the scene were neatly arranged,

92
00:05:16,079 --> 00:05:17,720
indicating the killer, in his childhood,

93
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,680
endured harsh and authoritarian discipline.

94
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:20,800
This type of killer

95
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,759
usually strikes near where he lives.

96
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,160
The medical examiner also noted

97
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,120
that although both victims' genitals

98
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,439
were mutilated,

99
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,199
neither was actually sexually assaulted.

100
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:31,120
Unpremeditated serial killings

101
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,480
are usually accompanied by sexual assault,

102
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,639
yet there are no such traces on the victims.

103
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,839
This suggests the killer

104
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:37,720
is very likely impotent.

105
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:46,439
Mom...

106
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,279
Mom, what happened to you?

107
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,519
Mom...

108
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,120
Mom!

109
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,560
Mom, wake up! Mom!

110
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,160
Gu Yan,

111
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,079
although we found this coin

112
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:01,240
at the crime scene,

113
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:03,000
it's very likely just a copycat crime.

114
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,480
Judging by the criminal profiling,

115
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,959
the killer in your mother's case

116
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:06,879
was meticulous and calculating.

117
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:08,920
It's unlikely to be this perpetrator.

118
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,519
Although that case back then

119
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,920
had a huge impact on the public,

120
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,600
the details about specific evidence

121
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,480
couldn't be known to outsiders.

122
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,959
This isn't a copycat crime.

123
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,360
Then what do you mean?

124
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:20,920
It's very likely

125
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,199
someone is directing this killer behind the scenes,

126
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,360
manipulating his actions.

127
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,240
This current case is more like a warning.

128
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,560
The high-IQ serial killer

129
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,839
from thirteen years ago...

130
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:31,959
he's back.

131
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:34,839
This time,

132
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,680
I'll find the truth with you.

133
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,920
I heard

134
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,920
it was murder.

135
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,959
What a tragedy!

136
00:06:40,079 --> 00:06:42,519
Even the prosecutor investigating the case was murdered.

137
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,920
Why do you think the main family

138
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,720
secretly sent Young Master Shen away?

139
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:47,879
The one who died this time was an illegitimate son.

140
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,360
What if the victim

141
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,000
had been the heir?

142
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,160
Brother...

143
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,560
Wait for me to come back.

144
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,160
I will avenge you.

145
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,600
Mom...

146
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,120
I will definitely find the killer

147
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,360
and avenge you.

148
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:35,120
Gu Yan.

149
00:07:35,279 --> 00:07:36,560
Long time no see.

150
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,639
Miss?

151
00:07:47,959 --> 00:07:49,360
I noticed you've been sitting here for a while.

152
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,360
Is there anything

153
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,439
I can help you with?

154
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:53,120
No, thank you.

155
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,800
The crime scene is nearby.

156
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,839
The killer lives in this area.

157
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,439
Premeditated, yet chaotically executed.

158
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,319
The crime scene

159
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:12,399
is a contradiction of order and frenzy.

160
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,839
A psychopathic killer.

161
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:15,480
If this is a serial killer,

162
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:17,160
he'll likely strike again very soon.

163
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,720
Frustrated with life,

164
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,600
working a menial job,

165
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,439
abused as a child...

166
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,600
Harming vulnerable women

167
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,920
gives him a twisted sense of validation

168
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,480
and gratification.

169
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:36,559
In contact with the detective captain,

170
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:38,720
in a wheelchair,

171
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,120
living alone—

172
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:43,240
a seemingly defenseless woman.

173
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,399
It's his most direct provocation

174
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:48,399
against the police and society.

175
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:50,279
Captain.

176
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,679
Sister Yan has trouble walking.

177
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,919
Why didn't you see her home?

178
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,440
I can act as bait.

179
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:55,279
No.

180
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:57,159
We do need to solve this case,

181
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:59,320
but not at the cost of putting you in danger.

182
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:02,639
Whether the killer targets me is just a matter of odds.

183
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,480
This afternoon,

184
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:04,919
just protect me from the shadows.

185
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
If nothing happens,

186
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,159
pull your team back.

187
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,720
What if he does show up?

188
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,879
In your current condition,

189
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,240
I can't rest easy either.

190
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:15,080
I'll shadow you home this afternoon.

191
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,759
Let me know immediately if anything happens.

192
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:19,039
Okay.

193
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,360
Three households on this floor:

194
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:24,200
a couple,

195
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,519
a family of four,

196
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,759
and me.

197
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,799
I've never seen this person.

198
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,039
It's him.

199
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,759
He changed his clothes

200
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:15,120
and has been following me.

201
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:25,240
Hello, honey?

202
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,639
Are you home?

203
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,159
I'm almost home.

204
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,159
Okay.

205
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:13,720
Honey?

206
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,480
Are you home?

207
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:16,919
Open the door.

208
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,159
One.

209
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:20,519
Two.

210
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:21,519
Three.

211
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,519
Four.

212
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,360
Five.

213
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,720
Ah!
